  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463334",
      "title": "Adding a \"Heal\" Functionality",
      "lectureOrder": 56,
      "videoOrder": 50,
      "sourceHash": "71341e41597b3241b5b3233e6506147168479916794b4f2a77e9dcb7768d0d56",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.2,
          "en": "So we can attack,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.2,
          "end": 6.55,
          "en": "we can launch a special attack every three rounds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.55,
          "end": 9.91,
          "en": "and we're already using some nice view features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.91,
          "end": 13.87,
          "en": "that make building such a game very very easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.87,
          "end": 16.03,
          "en": "Now let's move on to the next button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.03,
          "end": 17.65,
          "en": "to the heal button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.65,
          "end": 20.85,
          "en": "Maybe we as a player took too much damage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.85,
          "end": 22.76,
          "en": "and we wanna heal ourselves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.76,
          "end": 27.54,
          "en": "So we should implement a functionality for that as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 30.71,
          "en": "So in the methods of my view app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.71,
          "end": 33.87,
          "en": "I'm going to add a heal player method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 36.83,
          "en": "because the heal functionality, the heal button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.83,
          "end": 39.793,
          "en": "of course should heal the player not the monster.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.84,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "For that I'll calculate a heal value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 47.3,
          "en": "and we can use the same get random value function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.3,
          "end": 50.32,
          "en": "to get a random value between two boundaries,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.32,
          "end": 54.51,
          "en": "and it's up to you which values you wanna use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.51,
          "end": 58.22,
          "en": "Since the monster hits us between eight and 15,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.22,
          "end": 62.62,
          "en": "I want to get a heal value of let's say eight and 20,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.62,
          "end": 65.42,
          "en": "so between eight and 20.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.42,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "And now of course we'll just reach out to the player health",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 74.053,
          "en": "and simply add that calculated heal value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.19,
          "end": 78.47,
          "en": "But we should be careful here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.47,
          "end": 81.87,
          "en": "Always adding this heal value like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.87,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "would introduce a bug in our game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 90.02,
          "en": "because we could heal ourselves above 100 health.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.45,
          "end": 92.78,
          "en": "We start with 100 health",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.78,
          "end": 95.57,
          "en": "and we shouldn't be able to heal ourselves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.57,
          "end": 96.813,
          "en": "for more than that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.72999999999999,
          "end": 100.18,
          "en": "So to prevent that this happens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.18,
          "end": 103.35,
          "en": "we can add an if check here in heal player",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 105.59,
          "en": "and check if our player health",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.43,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "plus the calculated heal value would exceed 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 112.71000000000001,
          "en": "And if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.71000000000001,
          "end": 116.64,
          "en": "if we would heal ourselves above 100,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 120.79,
          "en": "then I instead want to set the player health to 100",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.79,
          "end": 123.86,
          "en": "so that we can't go higher than that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.86,
          "end": 125.9,
          "en": "And only in the else case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.9,
          "end": 129.44,
          "en": "if our current health plus the calculated heal value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.44,
          "end": 131.2,
          "en": "does not exceed 100,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.2,
          "end": 134.86,
          "en": "only then I wanna add the full heal value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.86,
          "end": 136.44,
          "en": "to the player health",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.44,
          "end": 140.603,
          "en": "simply to ensure that we can't go above 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.91,
          "end": 146.27,
          "en": "So, with that we got the heal player method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.27,
          "end": 148.79,
          "en": "now we can connect it to the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.79,
          "end": 152.39,
          "en": "by adding a click listener as we did many times before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.39,
          "end": 155.773,
          "en": "and by calling heal player just like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.61,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "And if we now save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 163.22,
          "en": "if I press heal initially, nothing happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.22,
          "end": 165.73,
          "en": "but if I launch a special attack,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.73,
          "end": 167.06,
          "en": "this works, I can attack",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.06,
          "end": 169.6,
          "en": "and now let's heal ourselves, that worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.6,
          "end": 171.32999999999998,
          "en": "Heal ourselves, that worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.32999999999998,
          "end": 172.8,
          "en": "So that's looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.8,
          "end": 174.75,
          "en": "But we're not fully done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.75,
          "end": 177.05,
          "en": "For one, healing ourselves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.05,
          "end": 180.42,
          "en": "should also count as a round in the game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.42,
          "end": 185.42,
          "en": "So of course here I also wanna increment the current round.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.61,
          "end": 190.42,
          "en": "In addition the monster should attack us thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.42,
          "end": 192.93,
          "en": "because just because we heal ourselves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.93,
          "end": 196.13,
          "en": "does not mean that the monster does nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.13,
          "end": 198.42000000000002,
          "en": "So once we're done healing ourselves,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.42000000000002,
          "end": 201.29,
          "en": "the monster will attack the player,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.29,
          "end": 204.163,
          "en": "and we do that by calling the attack player function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.41,
          "end": 207.14,
          "en": "And now with that, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.14,
          "end": 208.99,
          "en": "you see if I heal myself initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.99,
          "end": 211.06,
          "en": "my health still goes down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.06,
          "end": 213.63,
          "en": "because healing myself initially makes no sense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.63,
          "end": 217.14,
          "en": "I already have a health of 100, so we heal by nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.14,
          "end": 219.14,
          "en": "But the monster attacks us thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.14,
          "end": 220.503,
          "en": "and hence we take damage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.4,
          "end": 224.6,
          "en": "But of course we can still heal ourselves thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.6,
          "end": 229.433,
          "en": "and eventually well try to win that game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.96,
          "end": 232.49,
          "en": "Yeah, like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.49,
          "end": 234.49,
          "en": "So, that should work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.49,
          "end": 238.3,
          "en": "but of course we're still not done with the game at least",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.3,
          "end": 241.28,
          "en": "because we now have all those actions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.28,
          "end": 244.4,
          "en": "and the health bars change appropriately,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.4,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "but how does the game end?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 248.69,
          "en": "We want to ensure that either the monster",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.69,
          "end": 252.77,
          "en": "or the player wins or for the unlikely scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.77,
          "end": 256.95,
          "en": "that we both go below zero health, that we have a draw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.95,
          "end": 258.67,
          "en": "And that could happen by the way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.67,
          "end": 261.9,
          "en": "since we attack and the monster always attacks back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 261.9,
          "end": 265.56,
          "en": "we could launch an attack that takes the monster below zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.56,
          "end": 267.8,
          "en": "and then with its last blow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.8,
          "end": 270.97,
          "en": "the monster also takes us below zero health.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.97,
          "end": 273.21,
          "en": "So a draw would be possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.21,
          "end": 276.63,
          "en": "Well, let's work on those win and lose conditions next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.63,
          "end": 278.96,
          "en": "of course feel free to try implementing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 278.96,
          "end": 280,
          "en": "on your own first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280,
          "end": 282.28,
          "en": "before we then implement it together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 282.28,
          "end": 285.043,
          "en": "because that of course is a great practice.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
